Garmin refuses an account without Garmin Connect+ with 403 ForbiddenException. The message names the plan, and the exit code stays 1 (error) with status 403.
-- args --
nutrition
recent
2026-10-12
-- route GET /nutrition-service/food/recent/2026-10-12?start=0&limit=20 403 noeol --
{"message":"HTTP 403 Forbidden","error":"ForbiddenException"}
